|GKB============================== Evade Hunter ==============================
|GKB=|XX0   Syntax: cevade                                                       |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   This command allows you to potentially cover your tracks, causing    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   your last pursuer to lose track of you (great for leaving town       |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   in a hurry when the marks get up in arms). If you are highly         |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   skilled, you might get away with it twice!                           |GKB=
|GKB==========================================================================
